  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario para planear un viaje**",
      "",
      "| Qué | Palabras |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| Transporte | *flight · direct flight · stopover/layover · train ticket · single/return · rent a car* |",
      "| Alojamiento | *hotel · hostel · guesthouse · B&B · apartment · book a room · double/single room* |",
      "| Dinero | *budget · fare · deposit · refund · cheap/expensive · cost* |",
      "| Documentos | *passport · visa · ID card · boarding pass · travel insurance* |",
      "| Plan | *itinerary · schedule · sightseeing · day trip · tour · guide* |",
      "",
      "**Frases útiles para planear**",
      "",
      "- *I'd like to book … · I'm thinking of going to … · We're planning to + verbo.*",
      "- *How long should we stay? · What's the best way to get there?*",
      "- *It's better to + verbo · It's worth + -ing* (*It's worth visiting the castle.*)",
      "- *Make sure you + verbo* (asegúrate de…) · *Don't forget to + verbo.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo — falsos amigos y confusiones**",
      "",
      "- *Journey* (trayecto), *trip* (viaje corto, con vuelta), *travel* (verbo / viajar en general, **incontable**: *travel is fun*).",
      "- *Single* ticket = solo ida; *return* = ida y vuelta (en EE. UU.: *one-way / round-trip*).",
      "- *Fare* = precio de un billete; *fee* = tasa.",
      "- *Excursion* = excursión corta; *tour* = visita guiada.",
      "- *Reservation* en EE. UU. = reserva; en UK *booking*.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *itinerary* /aɪˈtɪnərəri/ · *luggage* /ˈlʌɡɪdʒ/ · *stopover* /ˈstɒpəʊvə/ · *insurance* /ɪnˈʃʊərəns/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
